      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe three patients with angina pectoris and uncommon electrocardiographic aspects during exercise test. These cases demonstrate the wide variability of the electrocardiographic changes and symptoms during exercise test and may by considered an example of myocardial response to spasm-related ischemia."},
